  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Hyper-G Hybrid System combines shaped Hyper-G with smooth Hyper-G Round in a configurable dual-poly setup. Players can install Hyper-G Round in the mains with Hyper-G in the crosses for deeper penetration and a more driving ball, or reverse the orientation to place Hyper-G in the mains for increased spin and a heavier trajectory. Available in 1.20 mm and 1.25 mm gauges, the system allows players to fine-tune the balance of power, control, penetration and spin without changing string families.",

    "zh": "Solinco Hyper-G Hybrid System 将异形 Hyper-G 与圆形 Hyper-G Round 组合成一个可调式双聚酯混穿系统。Hyper-G Round 做主线、Hyper-G 做横线时，更强调深度、穿透力和前冲球；反过来使用 Hyper-G 主线、Hyper-G Round 横线，则更强调旋转和更重的球质。提供 1.20 与 1.25 毫米两种规格，让球员可以在不更换球线家族的情况下，通过主横线方向调整力量、控制、穿透和旋转。"
  },

